        <mxCell id="python_src" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6F2FF;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#183153;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;project/src - STANDALONE PYTHON OPTION&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;main.py&lt;/b&gt; - planned entry / orchestration&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;config.py&lt;/b&gt; - planned settings&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;camera/camera.py&lt;/b&gt; - capture frames&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;camera/line_detection.py&lt;/b&gt; - estimate line position&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;sensors/light_sensor.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;sensors/distance_sensor.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;sensors/environment_sensor.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;navigation/line_follower.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;navigation/controller.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;navigation/obstacle_avoidance.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;hardware/motors.py&lt;/b&gt; - drive + tilt-steer commands via the PiBorg controller (API TBD)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;communication/mqtt_client.py&lt;/b&gt; - candidate telemetry publisher&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;All .py files are empty placeholders.&lt;/b&gt; Roles above are inferred from filenames and project notes." vertex="1">
